@ref Article 31 (src 1047-1054)
GIVEN `the premiums paid`              IS A NUMBER
      `the contract account value`     IS A NUMBER
      `the actual damage`              IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 31 — on termination for the Company's false information, premiums paid` `the premiums paid` `, account value` `the contract account value` `, damage` `the actual damage` MEANS
    max `the premiums paid` `the contract account value` PLUS `the actual damage`

